    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d372">

                <pb facs="0540" n="434" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg434"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Minister
                    Barrett.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Extract]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-06-02"><hi rendition="#italic">June 2,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Say to President Reyes that I am most favorably impressed by his proposals and
                    shall be glad to undertake negotiation on general lines suggested by him.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Root</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
